'''Cruise Ship Panic''' (豪華客船ハイパニック ''Gōka Kyakusen Haipanikku'', '''Luxury Liner Highpanic''') is the 16th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 114th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]] and is available up to {{2c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is around as difficult as, if not slightly more difficult than [[Restricted Area]]. [[Oldstrich]] makes a return in stages [[The Locked Suite|2]] and [[Pirates Breaking Rank|5]], and most of the stages are decently challenging, especially the [[Smooth Docking|last one]].

